## Before committing

Run the verification commands from §25 of the style guide:

```sh
gofmt -l .          # must print nothing
go vet ./...
go build ./...
go test -race ./...
```

Then walk the completion checklist in §26 of the style guide against your
diff. Do not commit if any check fails or was skipped without saying so.

